<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第一幕 · 五层工程</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>那五轮分别把答案放在了哪</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 17, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", marginBottom: 12}}>下面五层，每层只看三件事 —— 答案放在哪 / 它默认了什么 / 这个默认什么时候不成立</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", gap: 6, justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", height: 62, padding: "0 26px", background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.03)", border: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.20)", borderRadius: 6}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", flex: 1}}>Prompt Engineering</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", width: 140}}>管提示词</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", height: 62, padding: "0 26px", background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.03)", border: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.20)", borderRadius: 6}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", flex: 1}}>Context Engineering</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", width: 140}}>管上下文</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 30, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 17, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>模型里面 ↑ ｜ ↓ 模型外面</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", height: 62, padding: "0 26px", background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.03)", border: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.20)", borderRadius: 6}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", flex: 1}}>Harness Engineering</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", width: 140}}>管 harness</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", height: 62, padding: "0 26px", background: "transparent", border: "1px dashed rgba(28,31,35,0.22)", borderRadius: 6}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", flex: 1}}>Loop Engineering</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", width: 140}}>管循环</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", height: 62, padding: "0 26px", background: "transparent", border: "1px dashed rgba(28,31,35,0.22)", borderRadius: 6}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", flex: 1}}>Graph Engineering</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", width: 140}}>管编排</Text></Box></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, padding: 20, background: "rgba(138,90,0,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 18}}>五层都还在，但杠杆不在同一层——不是五代产品，也不是「越上面越高级」；五层同时在场，各管一件事。</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>05 / 37</Text></Box></Box>
